Z||000001||GodSend||03-13-2001||10:04 PM||||You should be able to get that for it, Check out  <A HREF="http://www.trader.ca" TARGET=_blank>http://www.trader.ca</A>  for asking prices.  <P>Hell, I bought my 87 Gt for $8000 last year, of course it did only have 90,000kms on, with some nice rims and a sweet paint job, leather, power everything.  But I would say that depending on the condition of yours thats about ballpark...||||reg||1
