Z||000005||GodSend||03-14-2001||09:43 AM||||Yup... about $5000 american. With a sweet 14 layer paint job (very expensive gold based).  No warping on the inside, no fading, no cracks.  And 60,000 miles, with some sweet tires and rims.  <P>I looked for awhile at several cars.  Either a 91+ MR2 (you have to admit they are nice looking), a 1990+ 300xz (expensive to fix though.. already went through that with my Talon TSI) ...  Typically the mr2's and 300's were asking around 12,000 - 13,000 for a 90-91 with almost 200,000kms...  I have bought high milage cars before and it simply is not worth it down the road..<P>When I was looking at fieros they were all priced around the same for the GTS (4000-6000) , but with 150,000+ km's, and not that great condition.  I consider my deal fair (There was a 88 for sale at the same time, same condition, similar miles, for 12,000  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"> )  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.hypernetcommunications.com/revn.gif"> ||||reg||1
